    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop participating in the performance\"... that's a heavy way to put it. i guess i don't really know what else to do. it feels like there's no version of the future where this doesn't just end in tragedy, so why should i keep pushing through the stress and the fear just to see it happen? if the outcome is already decided, why does the struggle even matter?",
